@startuml
actor Learner
participant "DEV Web" as Web
participant "GotIt Backend" as API
participant "Speech Provider" as Speech
Learner -> Web: Launch scoped practice
Web -> API: Create/resume session (stable creation key)
API --> Web: Session and authorized study cards
loop Applicable game stages
  Web -> API: Issue visible question or bounded matching board
  API --> Web: Opaque exercise and choice ids
  Learner -> Web: Answer, self-rate, skip or record
  alt Typed, selected, self-rated or skipped
    Web -> API: Submit attempt (stable key and frozen payload)
  else Pronunciation
    Web -> API: Assessment (stable key and bounded WAV)
    API -> Speech: Assess recording
    Speech --> API: Pronunciation result
  end
  API --> Web: Authoritative receipt, expected answer and XP
  opt Ambiguous response
    Web -> API: Retry identical intent or reconcile session history
    API --> Web: Original receipt and current aggregate totals
  end
  alt Incorrect matching or cloze
    Web --> Learner: Brief local feedback; retain board or sentence
    Web -> API: Issue fresh question for same item
    API --> Web: New opaque exercise and choices
  else Third listening letter error
    Web -> Web: Reveal authorized study word; queue once at end
    Web -> API: Submit actual assisted answer (stable key)
    API --> Web: Authoritative receipt and XP
  end
  Web -> Web: Owner-scoped checkpoint; discard raw audio
  Web --> Learner: Feedback and stage transition
end
Learner -> Web: Finish session
Web -> API: Complete session (idempotent close)
API --> Web: Authoritative aggregate totals and bonus
Web --> Learner: Original animation and actual summary
@enduml
